{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-140382",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1-\\text{i} & -1+3\\text{i} \\\\ 4\\text{i} & 3-8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-\\frac{4\\text{i}}{1-\\text{i}}){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1-\\text{i} & -1+3\\text{i} \\\\ 4\\text{i}+(-\\frac{4\\text{i}(1-\\text{i})}{1-\\text{i}}) & 3-8\\text{i}+(-\\frac{4\\text{i}(-1+3\\text{i})}{1-\\text{i}})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1-\\text{i} & -1+3\\text{i} \\\\ 4\\text{i}-4\\text{i} & \\frac{(3-8\\text{i})(1-\\text{i})+12+4\\text{i}}{1-\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1-\\text{i} & -1+3\\text{i} \\\\ 4\\text{i}-4\\text{i} & \\frac{7-7\\text{i}}{1-\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1-\\text{i} & -1+3\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result  is \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1-\\text{i} & -1+3\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
